      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "TICKETS HERE      This one is gonna be special.  LEMON BUCKET  returns after shutting down the PTBO folk fest in 2025, now ready to get the Electric City up on it's feet singing and dancing.     WHERE?   Gordon Best Theatre    WHEN?   March 17 2026, 8PM    WHY?   Because it's about time Lemon Bucket"
