    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "LEMON BUCKET ORKESTRA’S 15 YEAR TOUR    TICKET LINK   June 28 2025 at Corktown Pub  $30 adv / $40 door  We've been screaming folked-up ballads through busted megaphones for 15 years now (!)... you've seen us in parks and street corners, festivals and dive bars, performing arts centers and raves..."
      }
    ],
