    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "TICKET LINK     Lemon Bucket Orkestra. 15 years. A party. THE PARTY.   We've been screaming folked-up ballads through busted megaphones for 15 years now (!)... you've seen us in parks and street corners, festivals and dive bars, performing arts centers and raves...  And y'all know we don't shy away"
      }
