    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Lemon Bucket Orkestra. 15 years. A party. A tour. THE KITCHENER STOP    TICKET LINK   Sept 20 2025  Doors 8pm  Adv $30 / Door $40  We've been screaming folked-up ballads through busted megaphones for 15 years now (!)... you've seen us in parks and street corners, festivals and dive bars, performing"
